  {
    "episode_id": 93205,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/3/93205.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, you're a Wisconsin guy. There's no question about you're a Wisconsin dude. Yeah, you're. So tell us what's going on with COVID-19. I mean, you know, I hear a lot of a lot of things about testing going on. People really want to reopen the government. We want to open the country. You know, where do you stand with all that?",
