      {
        "text": "The listener’s geographical identity as a Wisconsinite grants them credibility on matters concerning pandemic response and policy.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Public sentiment toward reopening reflects genuine community-level priorities rather than just political rhetoric.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "It is appropriate and expected for individuals to express personal stances on large-scale societal decisions like reopening policies.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
