    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/3/93205.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, for CARES Act 2, what do you hear from people? Because we heard a lot from small businesses talking about how unemployment was impacting them. Basically saying though, that some of them were saying that their employees are actually getting paid more, to be unemployed and they would actually be working. I've heard that. I think the last PPP program addressed this issue by a lot of my Native American friends, old chunk or NIDA were saying that they couldn't get the funding because of, you know, the 30% were saying, if you have made more of your revenue from 30%, you can't get the funding. I think that's changed in the last PPP project. But for the CARES Act II, one of the things we think you guys will try to address that weren't addressed the first time.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
